1
00:00:00,614 --> 00:00:02,614
(Penny:)Why'd you get that?
You hate lamb.

2
00:00:02,683 --> 00:00:04,963
(Sheldon:)I was asking for directions.

3
00:00:05,118 --> 00:00:08,358
(Sheldon:)Apparently, there was
a communication problem.

4
00:00:08,488 --> 00:00:11,228
(Leonard:)I thought Amy was gonna drive
you home.

5
00:00:11,291 --> 00:00:14,861
(Sheldon:)I thought so, too,
but she's acting very strangely.

6
00:00:14,961 --> 00:00:18,201
(Sheldon:)I was discussing it with a Sri Lankan
fellow on the bus,

7
00:00:18,298 --> 00:00:22,678
(Sheldon:)and he hypothesized that a tiger may
have recently run across her shadow.

8
00:00:25,005 --> 00:00:27,815
(Sheldon:)Although he may have just been trying
to drum up business

9
00:00:27,874 --> 00:00:31,324
(Sheldon:)for his brother-in-law's
witch doctor practice.

10
00:00:33,513 --> 00:00:35,823
(Penny:)Okay, Sheldon,
what happened between you and Amy?

11
00:00:35,849 --> 00:00:39,389
(Sheldon:)Well, can you believe she said
I embarrassed her?

12
00:00:39,419 --> 00:00:41,559
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

13
00:00:41,588 --> 00:00:44,228
(Sheldon:)But you didn't even hear the details.

14
00:00:45,192 --> 00:00:46,232
(Penny:)Sheldon...

15
00:00:48,161 --> 00:00:51,901
(Leonard:)I've known you a long time,
and I'm going to tell you this

16
00:00:52,265 --> 00:00:54,905
(Leonard:)with all the love
I can possibly muster.

17
00:00:56,536 --> 00:00:59,026
(Leonard:)Amy's right. You're wrong.

